# DESK17(2) "before" + the ADINSDSK geometry dump: select the C: drive icon,
# open `Options -> Install icon...` and screendump the box with the *Options*
# title still inverted.  Then Cancel and screendump the bar again.
#   C: icon click            (38,35)   probe run desktop dump
#   Options title hover      (196,9)   probe run menu dump
#   "Install icon..." click  (280,43)  probe run menu dump (entry 3.1)
#   ID_CNCL click            (429,369) DESK03 run B geometry; this run's own
#                                      [probe] ADINSDSK lines re-confirm it
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1500 mark A_IDLE
2600 move 38 35
2900 down
2903 up
3200 move 600 240
4000 move 196 240
4100 move 196 9
4800 move 280 43
5100 down
5103 up
5400 move 600 240
6500 mark B_DIALOG
7600 move 429 369
7900 down
7903 up
8200 move 600 240
9300 mark C_CLOSED
10500 pause
